A story and a flow

The `App` calls the `API`, and the `API` calls the `Cache` and the `Database`.
Then write the story `read`: the `App` calls the `API` with the label `ask`,
the `API` calls the `Cache` with the label `miss`, and the `API` calls the
`Database` with the label `read`. Show both a flow and the sequence of `read`.
---
App -> API
API -> Cache, Database
story read {
  App -> API: ask
  API -> Cache: miss
  API -> Database: read
}
show flow
show sequence of read
